+\begin{prop}[Positive tensor presentation]\label{red:D:iso}
+Let $T_+$ and $T_{\mu,+}$ be the sources of $\Psi$ and ${\mu}\Psi$,
+respectively. All definitions below use the original ground $\mathbb S$.
